    "description": {
      "value": "<p data-start=\"1004\" data-end=\"1017\"><em data-start=\"1004\" data-end=\"1017\">(3rd Level)</em></p><p data-start=\"1019\" data-end=\"1059\">You anchor manifestations to declared metaphors.</p><p data-start=\"1061\" data-end=\"1134\">When you cast illusion or enchantment, you may declare a symbolic anchor:</p><ul data-start=\"1136\" data-end=\"1210\"><li data-start=\"1136\" data-end=\"1145\"><p data-start=\"1138\" data-end=\"1145\">Crown</p></li><li data-start=\"1146\" data-end=\"1155\"><p data-start=\"1148\" data-end=\"1155\">Chain</p></li><li data-start=\"1156\" data-end=\"1166\"><p data-start=\"1158\" data-end=\"1166\">Mirror</p></li><li data-start=\"1167\" data-end=\"1176\"><p data-start=\"1169\" data-end=\"1176\">Storm</p></li><li data-start=\"1177\" data-end=\"1185\"><p data-start=\"1179\" data-end=\"1185\">Fire</p></li><li data-start=\"1186\" data-end=\"1194\"><p data-start=\"1188\" data-end=\"1194\">Mask</p></li><li data-start=\"1195\" data-end=\"1203\"><p data-start=\"1197\" data-end=\"1203\">Hunt</p></li><li data-start=\"1204\" data-end=\"1210\"><p data-start=\"1206\" data-end=\"1210\">Etc.</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"1212\" data-end=\"1266\">If the metaphor is meaningfully relevant in the scene:</p><ul data-start=\"1268\" data-end=\"1285\"><li data-start=\"1268\" data-end=\"1285\"><p data-start=\"1270\" data-end=\"1285\">Gain Resonance.</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"1287\" data-end=\"1319\">If the metaphor is contradicted:</p><ul data-start=\"1321\" data-end=\"1347\"><li data-start=\"1321\" data-end=\"1347\"><p data-start=\"1323\" data-end=\"1347\">Immediately gain Strain.</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"1349\" data-end=\"1368\">This is not flavor.</p><p data-start=\"1370\" data-end=\"1402\">The metaphor must be maintained.</p>",
